{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24086","headline":"梦刘二十八因诗问之 · 白居易","name":"梦刘二十八因诗问之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜梦梦得，初觉思踟蹰。\n忽忘来汝郡，犹疑在吴都。\n吴都三千里，汝郡二百余。\n非梦亦不见，近与远何殊。\n尚能齐近远，焉用论荣枯。\n但问寝与食，近日两何如。\n病後能吟否，春来曾醉无。\n楼台与风景，汝又何如苏。\n相思一相报，勿复慵爲书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}